# nanoMODBUS module Kconfig
config NANOMODBUS
	bool "nanoMODBUS Modbus RTU/TCP library"
	default y
	help
	  Vendored nanoMODBUS (https://github.com/debevv/nanoMODBUS) exposed as a
	  Zephyr module so it can be reused across projects. Provides the Modbus
	  protocol implementation that hcp::modbus builds on.
